sly co-signed for a work-mate (Furuhata Takeshi). The original loan was 300,000 yen and once Takeshi had disappeared, the loan then fell on Kaiji.\n\nKaiji is then told of a way to clear the interest compounded debt (which stood at 3,850,000 yen), which involved getting on a boat with others in his position. Once on the boat the debtors would then have to gamble with loaned money, which would end with a few winning, and others getting into deeper debt and having to work to pay off their debts. After some coercion Kaiji accepts a position on the boat, in order to clear his debt and make a bit of money as well..."},"tags":[{"name":"Gambling","rank":99,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Class Struggle","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Death Game","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":78,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Crime","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Card Battle","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":71,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Yakuza","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Torture","rank":63,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Urban","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":53,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ships","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Athletics","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Prison","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Kaiji - Ultimate Survivor","english":"Kaiji - Ultimate Survivor","native":"逆境無頼カイジ Ultimate Survivor","romaji":"Gyakkyou Burai Kaiji: Ultimate Survivor","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"赌博默示录"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"逆境无赖开司 第